7:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T09:47:51Z","body":"True but I strongly suspect we're running into a bit  of a language barrier here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3314862521/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3314985624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107122#issuecomment-3314985624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107122","id":3314985624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FlqqY","user":{"login":"DSOE1024","id":90103853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTAzODUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90103853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024","html_url":"https://github.com/DSOE1024","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T13:54:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T13:54:59Z","body":"> > Most computers require support for Windows 7\n> \n> What do you base this on? Regardless Windows 7 is not supported itself, it's been EOL for the vast majority of versions for 5 and a half years, for most for over 10 and a half. The remaining normal PC support ended 2 and a half years ago\n\nFirst of all, I apologize—my English is not very good, and I didn’t express myself clearly in the previous issue. Let me explain why so many computers still rely on Windows 7. Here, at least from what I’ve observed, a vast number of teachers and students use Windows 7, which remains the most mainstream operating system in education. Additionally, a large portion of existing home computer users (who often use their devices for more than 10 years) and second-hand computer users still rely heavily on Windows 7. Many machines are simply running this system.\n\nOf course, adding new features inevitably sacrifices compatibility with older hardware and systems, but I believe it’s important to provide simple compatibility solutions. This would allow this large group of average users—especially including students and teachers—to more easily access the open-source Godot engine.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3314985624/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315000221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107122#issuecomment-3315000221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107122","id":3315000221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FluOd","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}"